- Initial Load Time: 8.2 seconds (P95)
- Bundle Size: 1.2 MB gzipped (including duplicated dependencies)
- Build Time: 25 minutes
- Deployment Frequency: 2-4 deployments/week
- Team Dependencies: High (coordination required for releases)
- Rollback Complexity: High (entire system)

