**Metrics:**
- Initial Load Time: Improved via lazy loading and shared dependency deduplication
- Bundle Size: Reduced by loading shared dependencies (React, design system) once
- Build Time: Per-module builds run independently without full-system rebuild
- Deployment Frequency: Each module deploys independently on its own schedule
- Team Dependencies: Low (independent deployments)
- Rollback Complexity: Low (single module)

**Team Feedback:**
> "Module Federation transformed our velocity. We went from 2 releases per week to 10+ per day. When we need to hotfix Claims, we deploy in 5 minutes without touching Provider or Eligibility." — Platform Engineering Lead

**Cost Savings:**
